<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Itron reduced to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Itron reduced to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>- Pacific Crest Securities downgraded Itron Inc to hold from buy based on the extended downturn in the utility sales cycle, analyst Rick Ownes said.</p>
<p>- The company still represents a &quot;compelling story&quot; over the long term, but stock is unlikely to move higher anytime soon, he said.</p>
<p>- Brokerage is reviewing earnings estimates after the company wanred it will lose money in the current third quarter.</p>
<p>- Itron was off 8 at 21.</p>
</text>
